  "details": "I am encountering an overly frequent issue with my works being illegally distributed on VRChat.\n\nI have identified numerous instances where all avatars on a specific world's pedestal or all avatars uploaded by a particular user are illegal distributions of my works. In both cases, the process to follow DMCA procedures is too cumbersome, consuming a significant amount of my resources and leading to exhaustion.\n\nIt should be made more difficult to upload content illegally and easier to report such activities under the DMCA.\n\nI would like the VRChat website to facilitate the listing of avatars within specific worlds and avatars uploaded by specific users, making it simpler to report illegal avatars.",
